==English==

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[leave]] [[someone|(someone)]] [[in]] [[the]] [[lurch]]}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[abandon]] somebody; especially, to abandon somebody and leave him or her in a [[difficult]] [[situation]].
#: ''He '''left me in the lurch''' and I had to finish the whole project by myself.''
#* ''Hudibras''
#*: But though thou'rt of a different church, / I will not '''leave thee in the lurch'''.

